      "snippet_id": "SNP-001",
      "snippet_text": "\"Active buyers decreased 3.4% year-over-year to 88.5 million. We reactivated 6.5 million buyers, up 2.1% from the prior year period, and acquired 4.8 million new buyers. GMS per active buyer on a trailing twelve month basis for the Etsy marketplace declined 3.5% year-over-year to $120. The number of habitual buyers was 6.2 million, down 11.0% year-over-year.\"",
